{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 162310, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 108725, "uid": 176744, "type": 4, "title": "天子培养", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1657946122, "updated_at": 1657957388, "updated_uid": 176744, "comment_at": 1660371279, "last_at": 1667930059, "comment_count": 2, "status": 1, "summary": "基础天子等级提升至满级#史莱姆获取方式为夜世界经验本#同属性史莱姆喂养时有10%经验加成好感突破至S#玛瑙获取方式为分解天子，以及各式各样的活动奖励。好感度提升给的属性比你从一级拉到满级还多，优先提升", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_574/h_880/1164/176744/2022/6/16/445190.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_562/h_889/1164/176744/2022/6/16/28511.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_574/h_880/1164/176744/2022/6/16/368884.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 3, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 7831, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 1, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 162310, "content": "<div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">基础</span></div></div><div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">天子等级提升至满级</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img data-width=\"574\" data-height=\"880\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_574/h_880/1164/176744/2022/6/16/445190.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_574/h_880/1164/176744/2022/6/16/445190.png\" style=\"width: 326px; height: 500px;\"><img data-width=\"562\" data-height=\"889\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_562/h_889/1164/176744/2022/6/16/28511.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_562/h_889/1164/176744/2022/6/16/28511.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 316px; height: 500px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\">#史莱姆获取方式为夜世界经验本</div><div class=\"div-img\">#同属性史莱姆喂养时有<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">10%经验加成</span></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">好感突破至S</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img data-width=\"574\" data-height=\"880\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_574/h_880/1164/176744/2022/6/16/368884.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_574/h_880/1164/176744/2022/6/16/368884.png\" style=\"width: 326px; height: 500px;\"><img data-width=\"574\" data-height=\"903\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_574/h_903/1164/176744/2022/6/16/533275.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_574/h_903/1164/176744/2022/6/16/533275.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 317px; height: 500px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">#玛瑙获取方式为分解天子，以及各式各样的活动奖励。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">好感度提升给的属性比你从<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">一</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">级拉到满级</span>还多，优先<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">提升好感。</span></span></div></div>\n                               </div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">塞满一身满级装备</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img data-width=\"366\" data-height=\"424\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_366/h_424/1164/176744/2022/6/16/68346.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_366/h_424/1164/176744/2022/6/16/68346.png\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\">#星级越高的装备越好，只保留5a装备</div><div class=\"div-img\">装饰和魂卡需要好感度解锁</div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"min-height: 2.66667rem; background: rgb(248, 248, 248); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img data-width=\"529\" data-height=\"919\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_529/h_919/1164/176744/2022/6/16/648457.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_529/h_919/1164/176744/2022/6/16/648457.png\" style=\"width:287px;height:500px;\"><img data-width=\"544\" data-height=\"576\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_544/h_576/1164/176744/2022/6/16/831482.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_544/h_576/1164/176744/2022/6/16/831482.png\" style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;width:331px;height:500px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">装备升级一般靠活动赠送的升级球就够了，地铁刷到的一般用于给魂卡升级。</div></div></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"></div></div>\n                               </div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">进化后继续拉满</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"580\" data-height=\"875\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_580/h_875/1164/176744/2022/6/16/962845.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_580/h_875/1164/176744/2022/6/16/962845.png\" style=\"width: 331px; height: 500px;\"><img data-width=\"575\" data-height=\"892\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_575/h_892/1164/176744/2022/6/16/401061.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_575/h_892/1164/176744/2022/6/16/401061.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 322px; height: 500px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">任何天子都可以最终进化到满级60.。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">进化时需消耗对应数量的同等级材料。例：5升6需要5只五星狗粮</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">绝对不要，<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">绝对不要</span>，<span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">绝对不要拿原生五星当狗粮！</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">狗粮获取一般是四星进化到五星作为狗粮和活动赠送的进化史莱姆。</span></span></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">搭配魂卡</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;<img data-width=\"567\" data-height=\"910\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_567/h_910/1164/176744/2022/6/16/713573.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_567/h_910/1164/176744/2022/6/16/713573.png\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">赠送的4星装备卷和地铁等弄来的垃圾装备主要就是给魂卡升级的</div></div>\n                               </div><br><br><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" style=\"\"><br><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">很好到这里我们已经拥有了60级满好感的天子一枚，几乎大部分场合都可以<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">凑合着</span>用了。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.37333rem;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">进阶</span></div></div></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container active-item\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">装备3a以上附魔</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img data-width=\"570\" data-height=\"561\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_570/h_561/1164/176744/2022/6/16/374960.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_570/h_561/1164/176744/2022/6/16/374960.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\">附魔最好保持一致性，如你2号位ns加成，3号位ss加成。就不是一个很好的组合</div><div class=\"div-img\">更多附魔攻略可以在wiki查找</div></div>\n                               </div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">天子界限突破</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img data-width=\"576\" data-height=\"906\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_576/h_906/1164/176744/2022/6/16/536068.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_576/h_906/1164/176744/2022/6/16/536068.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 297px; height: 470px;\"><img data-width=\"570\" data-height=\"828\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_570/h_828/1164/176744/2022/6/16/182556.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_570/h_828/1164/176744/2022/6/16/182556.png\" style=\"width: 323px; height: 470px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">最高突破至加6。每次突破可增加<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">技能等级上限</span>，增加<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">天子基础属性。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">突破至加6后成为p，原因时你的天子图鉴右上角会出现p的标志。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"179\" data-height=\"98\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_179/h_98/1164/176744/2022/6/16/406958.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_179/h_98/1164/176744/2022/6/16/406958.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\">五角星意味着60级满级，p的标志意味着60级加6。</div><div class=\"div-img\">左下角的S是这个天子已经到达s好感度了。</div></span></div></div>\n                               </div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">魂卡突破</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img data-width=\"540\" data-height=\"896\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_540/h_896/1164/176744/2022/6/16/125448.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_540/h_896/1164/176744/2022/6/16/125448.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 同名魂卡闪卡要<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">略微</span>强与普通卡<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">一点，</span>有闪卡优先培育闪。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 喂同名卡时，根据狗粮的加值提升加值，<span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">比如你拿一张+4的普通卡喂一张+0的闪卡能得到+5的闪卡</span>，所以无需顾忌要不要先投资普通卡。最高可突破到+5。</span></span></div></div>\n                               </div><br><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">点火</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\">在夜世界锻造屋处可以制作点火石。<div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img data-width=\"551\" data-height=\"814\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_551/h_814/1164/176744/2022/6/16/749733.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_551/h_814/1164/176744/2022/6/16/749733.png\" style=\"width: 202px; height: 300px;\"><img data-width=\"567\" data-height=\"761\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_567/h_761/1164/176744/2022/6/16/164524.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_567/h_761/1164/176744/2022/6/16/164524.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 223px; height: 300px;\"><img data-width=\"545\" data-height=\"756\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_545/h_756/1164/176744/2022/6/16/406386.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_545/h_756/1164/176744/2022/6/16/406386.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 216px; height: 300px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\">点火材料来源主要靠氪金和各种活动。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center; \"><img data-width=\"568\" data-height=\"942\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_568/h_942/1164/176744/2022/6/16/314712.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_568/h_942/1164/176744/2022/6/16/314712.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 你使用的第一颗石头决定了点火的最终加成方向，每多点一下，相当于增强点火属性。点火会改变技能效果，对于一些<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">天子某些点火是质变</span>，详情可自寻参考图鉴。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center; \"><img data-width=\"560\" data-height=\"789\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_560/h_789/1164/176744/2022/6/16/892251.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_560/h_789/1164/176744/2022/6/16/892251.png\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 点了几火</span>就意味着点到了第几个星星变成红色。如图把这个格子点了后，丽莎就点了3火。</div></span><br></div></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">温泉五十级</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">因为日服泡温泉并<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">不加好感度</span>。所以你需要买对应的礼物或者用通用礼物来提升好感等级。</span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"564\" data-height=\"862\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_564/h_862/1164/176744/2022/6/16/191731.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_564/h_862/1164/176744/2022/6/16/191731.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\">详情可参考温泉攻略</div></div>\n                               </div><br><br></div><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">到这里，你几乎就已经是达到了准毕业的程度了。</span></div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">毕业</span></div></div><br></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">一身3s装备对应装备和魂卡。</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img data-width=\"299\" data-height=\"103\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_299/h_103/1164/176744/2022/6/16/137260.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_299/h_103/1164/176744/2022/6/16/137260.png\"></div></div>\n                               </div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">满级温泉</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"567\" data-height=\"666\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_567/h_666/1164/176744/2022/6/16/238984.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_567/h_666/1164/176744/2022/6/16/238984.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">3星上限为80，四星上限为90，五星上限为100。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">详情可参考温泉攻略。</div></div>\n                               </div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">对应的玩偶</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"560\" data-height=\"864\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_560/h_864/1164/176744/2022/6/16/520874.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_560/h_864/1164/176744/2022/6/16/520874.png\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 771px;\"><img data-width=\"549\" data-height=\"196\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_549/h_196/1164/176744/2022/6/16/456795.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_549/h_196/1164/176744/2022/6/16/456795.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 500px; height: 178px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">玩偶具体搭配可参考攻略或询问群里真大佬。</div></div>\n                               </div><div class=\"div-img\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><div class=\"div-img\">短时间内，再无敌手。</div></span><br></div><br><div><br></div><br><br><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" style=\"\"><br></div><br><div><br></div><br><br></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_574/h_880/1164/176744/2022/6/16/445190.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_562/h_889/1164/176744/2022/6/16/28511.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_574/h_880/1164/1